    "turn_idx": 2,
    "turn_text": "We are down to the last two shows of our series of pre-election visits with the candidates for statewide office. Now, we included both candidates on the same show for most of those offices, but we have reserved a full hour for the gubernatorial candidates. Now, each Mr. Cordray and Mr. DeWine got a list of the same topics in advance and the amount of time that was allocated for each subject. Mr. Cordray and Mr. DeWine then came in separately and visited our studio. And by flip of the coin, today we're going to spend time hearing from Republican candidate for Governor Mike DeWine. Just to get us rolling, Mr. DeWine, a couple of minutes to introduce yourself, your personal professional background. Let folks know a little bit about Mike DeWine.",
