    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80456.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "You know, I picked John Houston because number one, I think he's exceedingly well qualified to really play a major role in my administration. I wanted someone who had experience who really would compliment some of the experiences that I have. He spent a number of years in the state legislature. He was the speaker of the Ohio House, as you know, and had that experience and that experience with budgets. He's a real leader. Someone, frankly, that shares my passion, shares my commitment to families. John is a person who really is devoted to his family, but is also devoted to families around the state. And we really look at things kind of the same way, that families, our job in government is to protect families, help families, make their lives better. And John shares that passion.",
