  {
    "episode_id": 80456,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80456.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 17,
    "turn_text": "We won't have time to drill down into specifics before the break. We will do that afterwards. But as we chat here with Mike DeWine, the Republican candidate for Ohio Governor, assess the state of the economy in Ohio. The big picture, if you would, Mr. DeWine, on where we are and where we should be.",
