        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The timing of the interview allows for structured shifts between general and detailed discussion.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes it is appropriate to solicit policy views from a gubernatorial candidate during a public forum.",
