    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Topic Shift"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 80456,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/0/80456.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "Well, I don't think anyone's ever happy with exactly where we should be. We always want to do better. We've come a long way, though, in the last eight years. I mean, we talked about this, but if you looked at where we were eight years ago, our unemployment was double-digit. It was over 10%. We had people looking for jobs, very difficult circumstances. We had lost over 400,000 jobs. So we've come back in the last eight years. We've regained those 400,000 jobs plus more jobs. I think we're moving forward. We have some problems that we have to fill. I mean, when I talk to businessmen and women today, it's not what it was eight years ago. Our problem today is that we can't find people to work. And what employers tell me is that they have a hard time finding people who have the skill sets that they need, but they also, in many cases, have a hard time finding people who can pass a drug test. So that's a big challenge and it's not just the tragedy of the drug problem is not just the number of people who die every day and that's horrible. But the other problem is what it does to our economy really slows our economy down. We have a large number of people who are out there who simply cannot live up to their God-given potential and that's that is that slows our economy down. We got to fix it.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_00",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
      {
        "text": "Unemployment was over 10% eight years ago.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "The country lost over 400,000 jobs eight years ago.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "We have regained more than 400,000 jobs in the past eight years.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Employers today struggle to find workers with needed skill sets.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Employers today face difficulties hiring workers who pass drug tests.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Drug use negatively impacts economic productivity.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "A significant portion of the population cannot fulfill their potential due to drug issues.",
