    "turn_idx": 37,
    "turn_text": "It's very important that the governor of Ohio have a good relationship with Congress. I will certainly do that through my relationship with our great congressional delegation. I will work with both Democrats and Republicans and our congressional delegation. It's also important for the governor of the state of Ohio to have a good working relationship with the White House, with the president of the United States, whether that president is of the same party or a different party. So I will guarantee you that I will do that. I will have a good relationship because we will be asking the federal government for waivers, for example, for them to be less restrictive in the area of education, less restrictive in other areas as well. So that good relationship is very, very important. On the flip",
